  "html": "<article id=\"post-4972\" class=\"container post-4972 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Hagan Air joins forces with Carolina Heating Service</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2021-03-17T15:59:00+00:00\">March 17, 2021</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:07:17+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-company-portrait-featuring-all-of-the-employees-standing-in-front-of-the-Carolina-Heating-Service-building.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service company portrait, featuring all of the employees standing in front of the Carolina Heating Service building\" decoding=\"async\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hagan Air of Anderson became a NearU company in September 2020 and is now joining forces with Carolina Heating Services . As of this year the Hagan Heating and Air location was discontinued and was integrated in Carolina Heating.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">“Hagan Heating and Air has loyally served thousands of customers over the last three decades. Their local brand is associated with premium and honest customer service. We look forward to building on this reputation by providing more bandwidth and expertise to the talented Hagan team. Our portfolio in Upstate South Carolina now boasts two strong and strategically-combined local brands: Carolina Heating Services in Greenville and Hagan Heating and Air in Anderson . We welcome the customers and employees of Hagan Heating and Air to the rapidly growing NearU family,” said Ashish Achlerkar, NearU’s Founder, Chairman and CEO.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">“At Hagan, we have worked hard and honestly to always do right by our customers and employees. We chose to transition our brand to NearU because of our confidence in NearU’s vision for the HVAC industry. The NearU team delivered a fair value to our shareholders and a clear plan to add more value to our customers and employees. I am confident that our customer and employee experience will further flourish under NearU’s ownership. I am committed to partnering in that endeavor in my new role as a NearU team member,” said Paul Hagan , the Founder of Hagan Heating and Air.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">“I am thrilled to update and share with you the wonderful journey Hagan has completed this year. A journey of immense growth, to better take care of you and all my valued Hagan Customers. As most of you may know, Hagan Heating &amp; Air has joined forces with Carolina Heating Service to better serve you. I am continuing to work and have enjoyed settling into my new role as part of the amazing Carolina Heating Service team. I cannot say enough great things about Carolina Heating Service . Their expertise, over 40 years of experience, and support from NearU make me 100% confident that my customers will be taken care of just as I always strived to do.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I look forward to continuing to serve you and taking care of your comfort needs.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thank You again for your continued loyalty,</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Paul Hagan”</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a href=\"/about-us/blog\">Read All Blog Posts</a>\n\t<div class=\"my-4 nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--4-up multi-component-container--uniform-height\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/air-conditioning-installation-costs-greenville-sc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"359\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An exterior of a building with multiple AC units and 